----------------------------------------------------------------------
Clean-room algorithm references (no Mixxx source or binaries bundled)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

vibemix includes Apache-2.0 clean-room implementations of DJ timing and
mixing primitives whose behavior was checked against public Mixxx concepts and
separate research notes. This notice is an attribution and review aid; vibemix
does not bundle, link, or redistribute Mixxx source code or binaries.
The detailed source-file reference map lives in `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.

- Mixxx — GPLv2 or later  https://github.com/mixxxdj/mixxx
  Reference scope in vibemix:
  - EngineXfader-style constant-power crossfader math:
    src/vibemix/audio/xfade.py, src/vibemix/audio/miniplayer.py
  - EngineBufferScaleLinear-style fractional cursor/miniplayer behavior:
    src/vibemix/audio/miniplayer.py
  - AnalyzerSilence-style -60 dB first/last audible bounds:
    src/vibemix/audio/cues.py
  - beats.cpp / BpmControl-style beatgrid distance and nearest-beat behavior:
    src/vibemix/audio/grid.py
  - sync / bpmcontrol-style beatmatch phase and tempo-fold grading:
    src/vibemix/learn/beatmatch_judge.py
  - AutoDJProcessor-style transition timing algebra:
    src/vibemix/state/transition_clock.py

